// Mormon's map in relative miles. This is not a real-world location.
// Origin: the city of Zarahemla. x grows toward the east sea. y grows "northward".
// Positions combine John L. Sorenson's figures and his mileage estimates in
// Mormon's Map (FARMS, 2000). His figures are not always drawn to one scale,
// so the text estimates (chapter 5) control when they disagree.

